{"path":"iterator/ostream_iterator/operator=","title":"std::ostream_iterator<T,CharT,Traits>::operator=","titleHtml":"<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::ostream_iterator&lt;T,CharT,Traits&gt;::</span>operator=","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/iterator/ostream_iterator/operator=","section":"iterator","kind":"page","summary":"If out_stream is a pointer to the associated std::basic_ostream and delim is the delimiter specified at the construction of this object, then the effect is equivalent to","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl\" id=\"Version_1\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">ostream_iterator<span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> operator<span class=\"sy1\">=</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span> <span class=\"kw4\">const</span> ostream_iterator<span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> <span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td> (1) </td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl\" id=\"Version_2\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">ostream_iterator<span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> operator<span class=\"sy1\">=</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span> <span class=\"kw4\">const</span> T<span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> value <span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td> (2) </td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"t-li1\"><span class=\"t-li\">1)</span> Copy assignment operator. Assigns the contents of <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">other</span></code></div>\n<div class=\"t-li1\"><span class=\"t-li\">2)</span> Inserts <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">value</span></code> into the associated stream, then inserts the delimiter, if one was specified at construction time.</div>\n<p>If <code>out_stream</code> is a pointer to the associated <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/io/basic_ostream\">std::basic_ostream</a></span> and <code>delim</code> is the delimiter specified at the construction of this object, then the effect is equivalent to\n</p><p><code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"sy2\">*</span>out_stream <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> value<span class=\"sy4\">;</span><br>\n<span class=\"kw1\">if</span> <span class=\"br0\">(</span>delim <span class=\"sy3\">!</span><span class=\"sy1\">=</span> <span class=\"nu0\">0</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><br>\n&nbsp; &nbsp; <span class=\"sy2\">*</span>out_stream <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> delim<span class=\"sy4\">;</span><br>\n<span class=\"kw1\">return</span> <span class=\"sy2\">*</span>this<span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></code>\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Parameters\">Parameters</h3>\n<table class=\"t-par-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-par\">\n<td> value\n</td>\n<td> -\n</td>\n<td> the object to insert\n</td></tr></table>\n<h3 id=\"Return_value\">Return value</h3>\n<p><code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"sy2\">*</span>this</span></code>\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Notes\">Notes</h3>\n<p><code>T</code> can be any class with a user-defined <code>operator&lt;&lt;</code>.\n</p><p>Prior to C++20, the existence of the copy assignment operator relied on the <a href=\"/w/cpp/language/as_operator#Implicitly-defined_copy_assignment_operator\">deprecated implicit generation</a>.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Example\">Example</h3>\n<div class=\"t-example\">\n<pre data-lang=\"cpp\"><code><span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;iostream&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;iterator&gt;</span>\n&nbsp;\n<span class=\"kw4\">int</span> main<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/iterator/ostream_iterator\"><span class=\"kw675\">std::<span class=\"me2\">ostream_iterator</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><span class=\"kw4\">int</span><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span> i1<span class=\"br0\">(</span><a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a>, <span class=\"st0\">\", \"</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <span class=\"sy2\">*</span>i1<span class=\"sy2\">++</span> <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> <span class=\"nu0\">1</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span> <span class=\"co1\">// usual form, used by standard algorithms</span>\n    <span class=\"sy2\">*++</span>i1 <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> <span class=\"nu0\">2</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    i1 <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> <span class=\"nu0\">3</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span> <span class=\"co1\">// neither * nor ++ are necessary</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/iterator/ostream_iterator\"><span class=\"kw675\">std::<span class=\"me2\">ostream_iterator</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><span class=\"kw4\">double</span><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span> i2<span class=\"br0\">(</span><a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    i2 <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> <span class=\"nu16\">3.14</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">'<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>'</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">}</span></code></pre>\n<p>Output:\n</p>\n<pre data-output=\"1\"><code>1, 2, 3, 3.14</code></pre> \n</div>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Parameters","id":"Parameters"},{"depth":3,"text":"Return value","id":"Return_value"},{"depth":3,"text":"Notes","id":"Notes"},{"depth":3,"text":"Example","id":"Example"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C++ reference"},{"path":"iterator","title":"Iterator library"},{"path":"iterator/ostream_iterator","title":"std::ostream_iterator"}],"children":[],"map":{"label":"std::ostream_iterator<T,CharT,Traits>::operator=","children":[{"label":"Declarations","note":"2 declarations. Copy assignment operator. Assigns the contents of other"},{"label":"Parameters","note":"value"},{"label":"Return value","note":"*this"},{"label":"Notes","note":"T can be any class with a user-defined operator<<."},{"label":"Example"}]},"standards":[],"wordCount":164,"codeBlockCount":2}
